1. **Guided 2 — Same structure, new numbers -1 and 22. Explain why your representation matches the situation (an East Texas trail hike near Tyler).**
   - *Teacher/self-check note:* Scale or operate consistently; label units; verify with a second method (table, line, or estimate).

