2. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 8, 3, or 48. Teacher checks method + units.
3. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 8, -1, or 27. Teacher checks method + units.
4. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 8, 2, or 46. Teacher checks method + units.
5. Use the taught procedure; expect a reasoned numeric or simplified-ratio/expression answer involving 8, 5, or 25. Teacher checks method + units.
