## Teach

### Big idea

Today''s skill — **One-Step Addition and Subtraction Equations** — sits inside equations & inequalities. In Grade 6 we build flexible representations: words, tables, diagrams, number lines, and symbols. A correct answer with no representation is weaker evidence of understanding than a clear diagram plus a checked result.

